-- Schedule 1, Parts 2 and 3: one row of a table is the words of a descriptor
-- (column 2) and its points (column 3) against its activity (column 1).
DECLARE `a row of Schedule 1` HAS
    `its activity` IS AN `an activity of Schedule 1`
    `its letter` IS A `a letter of a descriptor`
    `its points` IS A NUMBER
    `its words` IS A STRING
